id=codm-optimizer
name=CODM Optimizer
version=v1.1.0
versionCode=10100
author=DinoCore-Dev
description=Thermal-aware optimiser for Call of Duty: Mobile (Global, Garena, VNG, Tencent) with a web interface for KernelSU/APatch. Eases GPU and refresh before the thermal limit, tunes CPU ramp, network and the Android Game Mode API only while CODM is in front, and reverts everything when it closes. No game files, no memory patching, no cheats.
